{"parse": {"title": "9TH-02", "pageid": 97008, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/9TH-01\" title=\"9TH-01\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">9TH-02</span><a href=\"/wiki/9TH-03\" title=\"9TH-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">9TH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">02</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.AE.9E.E8.B4.A8.E4.B8.8E.E7.8E.AF\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"实质与环\">实质与环</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 实质与环</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">More than Circles</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>首<span class=\"color-value\"></span>尾<span class=\"color-value\"></span>衔<span class=\"color-value\"></span>接<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>环<span class=\"color-value\"></span>？<span class=\"color-value\"></span>这<span class=\"color-value\"></span>远<span class=\"color-value\"></span>不<span class=\"color-value\"></span>足<span class=\"color-value\"></span>以<span class=\"color-value\"></span>概<span class=\"color-value\"></span>括<span class=\"color-value\"></span>“<span class=\"color-value\"></span>命<span class=\"color-value\"></span>运<span class=\"color-value\"></span>”<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>实<span class=\"color-value\"></span>质<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 10902</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_6_bg_kafeiguan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_6_bg_kafeiguan\"><img alt=\"2_6_bg_kafeiguan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/Cg-2_6_bg_kafeiguan.png/600px-Cg-2_6_bg_kafeiguan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/Cg-2_6_bg_kafeiguan.png/900px-Cg-2_6_bg_kafeiguan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/Cg-2_6_bg_kafeiguan.png/1200px-Cg-2_6_bg_kafeiguan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>据《乌斯怀亚新闻报》报道，大约一周前，乌斯怀亚的码头被神秘术破坏，现在，所有的船只都毁于一旦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>司辰，这会和重塑之手，亦或叛变的芝诺部队有关系吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>不能确定。但我们到达乌斯怀亚已有数日，这里平静得超乎寻常。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>在自由海风号的事故之后，我们就丢失了重塑的踪迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>重塑之手似乎隐匿在某个不为人知的角落，一个普通人不会轻易踏足的地方。亦或说，他们离开了乌斯怀亚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>他们再也不像往常一样，在各地积极促进“暴雨”的进程……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>这并不是一个好消息。他们有可能在谋划一些更为可怕的东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>如果目击信息属实，我们就能印证基金会从飞蛾处得到的重要线索：德洛丝女士确实被叛变的伊戈尔一行人带到了乌斯怀亚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>但是，司辰……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>第一助手欲言又止。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>自我们来到火地岛以来，基金会并没有足够的时间对这儿展开详尽调查。如果这里和重塑有关系……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>离乌斯怀亚最近的基金会分部，在布宜诺斯艾利斯，有3200公里……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>最新消息是，那儿目前正忙着处理伊戈尔养子叛变所留下的混乱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>是的，重塑之手完全有能力在这段时间在这里进行渗透——就像他们对待那个名为奇索斯的镇子一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>但寻找德洛丝女士的任务同样紧迫。抱歉，我想我们没有时间再等下去了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>乌斯怀亚并不是一个特别大的城市。只要重塑之手在这里活动过，我们肯定会发现线索的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>我明白了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>我们一定会完成任务的，司辰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>经过一出“亡命天涯”的闹剧之后，咖啡馆已恢复了往日的宁静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>好消息是，追缉虚构集的宪兵已经消失；坏消息是，连带着她的同伴也不见踪影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>噢……他们真的走了。好吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>“那就永别了，亲爱的虚构集——”那根本算不上一个真正的道别！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>我们本可以互换最后一首诗歌，在咖啡馆里轮流念一遍，然后将它永远铭记在泪水里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>但伟大的神秘学家诗人说得对——我们不应该庆祝离别这种不幸，这是不明智的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>唔？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>没什么，两位请坐。请给我们一壶加了薄荷的马黛茶！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>谢谢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>虚构集颇有兴趣地打量着基金会的女孩们，她们正小心翼翼地接过滚烫的茶水。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>你们正在寻找德洛丝女士吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>从你们的表情中，我能看出她对你们来说非常重要。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>是的。请您详细描述一下，您与德洛丝女士遇见的经过吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>当然可以。德洛丝女士与我相遇于一个太阳被阴云遮蔽的下午……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_6_bg_jietou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_6_bg_jietou\"><img alt=\"2_6_bg_jietou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Cg-2_6_bg_jietou.png/600px-Cg-2_6_bg_jietou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Cg-2_6_bg_jietou.png/900px-Cg-2_6_bg_jietou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Cg-2_6_bg_jietou.png/1200px-Cg-2_6_bg_jietou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-311401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-311401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-311401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>在玻利瓦尔公寓外的街道，赶着去邮局寄信的我遇上了一位盲眼女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-311401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-311401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-311401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>在当时，那位女士突然把我叫住，那是一个奇妙的时刻——她走了上来，将我衣服上的毛衣断线系上，仿佛这是一个神圣而包罗万象的举动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-311410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-311410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-311410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>我几乎没能握住手中的信封。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div>这位小姐，你知道那儿是什么地方吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-311410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-311410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-311410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>我看到了那位女士，她的手指精准地指向了一个方向。也就是说，她很清楚自己的目的地位于何处——这对一位盲人来说是多么的神奇！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>女士，那里是科马拉监狱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>难道那是您的目的地吗？如果您想要去那里，也许我可以为您引路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div>谢谢你，小姑娘……但我想，我已经找到了我该走的路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-311410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-311410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-311410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>神灵同时给予她书籍与黑夜，那可真是一个绝妙的讽刺。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>女士，我可以得知您的名字吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div>……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>请放心，我不是什么奇怪的人……我猜您是一位作家，是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>恰好我也在进行小说的写作……我总有一种预感，您很快就会出现在我的小说中！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>您也知道，灵感总是不请自来的，就像一些讨人厌的访客。我很难判断该用什么样的东西招待它们——所以，最好的办法就是全部记录下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div>哈哈……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-311410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-311410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-311410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>时至今日，我还记得她的笑容——一个出奇的笑，一个遥远的笑，一个跨越了时间、实质与世纪总和的笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div>也许比较突然，但……小姐，我有一个问题想要问你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div>对你来说，“文学”代表着什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311414.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-311414.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311414.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311414.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-311414.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311414.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-311414.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311414.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>这可把我难住了——一个超乎创作范畴的问题！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div>你是一位具有文学追求的作家——但你是否想过，这种追求到底是从何而来？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>……实际上，我不知道怎么回答您的问题，女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>就我个人的感受来说，也许文学只是文学，它不能替任何人回答问题……何况是一个关于它自身的问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>我想，也许文学能做到的只是从某种截然不同的角度抛出问题，而这也正是我贸然猜测您职业的缘由。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div>一个很有趣的说法，我明白了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div>那么，它给你带来了一种怎样的感受呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>……感受吗？有时我觉得自己像个学习口语的孩子，正努力地念出书本第一页的第一个词汇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>等等，这个比喻也许并不恰当，需要更为精妙、更为直观的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-311410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-311410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-311410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>就在纠结比喻措辞的时候，余光里的她轻飘飘地挥了挥手，随后穿过乌斯怀亚的细雪，朝监狱的方向走去了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_6_bg_kafeiguan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_6_bg_kafeiguan\"><img alt=\"2_6_bg_kafeiguan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/Cg-2_6_bg_kafeiguan.png/600px-Cg-2_6_bg_kafeiguan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/Cg-2_6_bg_kafeiguan.png/900px-Cg-2_6_bg_kafeiguan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/Cg-2_6_bg_kafeiguan.png/1200px-Cg-2_6_bg_kafeiguan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>所以，德洛丝女士一定是往科马拉监狱去了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>您是什么时候遇到她的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>应该是三天前。那天短暂地出了一会儿太阳，街道上全是融化的雪水。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>如果有需要，我可以再为你们介绍一番科马拉监狱——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的暗示之意已经逐渐变成昭然若揭的明示了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>三天前……司辰，这意味着我们还有机会追上她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>是的。我们应该立刻进入科马拉监狱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>对，就是这样……不对，她竟然就这样斩钉截铁地说了出来……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>真是一位有魄力的人物！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>我能说什么呢？当一个不可思议的巧合来得过于轻易的时候，我们总是会质疑作者的机械降神，觉得这是一个很烂的桥段。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她很快和自己还有作者和解了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>但不要紧，在一个白日只有四个小时的季节，一座以关押神秘学家作为历史叙事的小镇，发生什么事情都不稀奇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>感谢您的协助，这位——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>无需客气，叫我虚构集就好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我是维尔汀。这位是十四行诗，我们来自圣洛夫基金会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>您好，虚构集小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>我很高兴我能帮上忙，维尔汀，十四行诗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩狡黠地眨了眨眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>还有什么比这更巧的事情呢？你们要去科马拉监狱，我也要去科马拉监狱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>最终我们都会在科马拉监狱里相遇，也许这就是神秘学家的宿命……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>虚构集小姐，您为什么要去科马拉监狱呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>哈哈，那必然是出于一些文学方面的原因——总之，从现在起，我们是朋友了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>让我们出发吧！我想，你们至少需要一个熟悉当地情况的人来带路。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "9TH-02"}}